<title>USA: RFID names O'Hearn as CEO.</title>
<headline>RFID names O'Hearn as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>RFID Systems Corp named Patrick O'Hearn as the new president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>O'Hearn most recently held the post of vice president and general manager of the communications division of Cirrus Logic.</p>
<p>A spokesperson was not immediately available to comment on who O'Hearn was replacing.</p>
</text>
